            %br/
          %p
            On properties of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quark-gluon+plasma"} quark-gluon plasma
            in comparison to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lattice+QCD"} lattice QCD
            results:
          %p
            %a{:href => "#JokelaJärvinenPiispa24"}> Jokela, Järvinen &amp; Piispa 2924
            \:
          %blockquote
            %p
              “
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holographic+QCD"} Holographic QCD
              has reached the level of sophistication that allows for a detailed reproduction of numerous
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lattice+QCD"} lattice QCD
              outcomes”
          %p
            %br/
          %p
            NB: These computations so far all use just the field theory in the bulk, not yet the stringy modes (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/limit+of+a+sequence"} limit
            of vanishing
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+length"} string length
            = succeed ")." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msqrt
                      %mrow
                        %mi α
                        %mo ′
                    %mo →
                    %mn 0
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \sqrt{\alpha'} \to 0
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#SonnenscheinWeissman18"} Sonnenschein &amp; Weissman 2018
          %h2#embedding_into_the_standard_model_of_particle_physics Embedding into the standard model of particle physics
          %p
            %a{:href => "#Nastase03"}> Nastase 03, p. 2
            \:
          %blockquote
            %p
              An obvious question then is can one lift this
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/intersecting+D-brane+model"} D brane construction
              for the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holographic+QCD"} holographic dual of QCD
              to a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/standard+model+of+particle+physics"} Standard Model
              embedding? I study this question in the context of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/intersecting+D-brane+models"} D-brane-world
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/GUT"} GUT
              models and find that one needs to have
              = succeed "." do
                %span.newWikiWord
                  TeV-scale string theory
                  %a{:href => "/nlab/new/TeV-scale+string+theory"} ?
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hadron+supersymmetry"}> hadron supersymmetry
                ,
